# LoanClear local configuration (template, safe to commit).
# Copy to .env.local and fill in locally. .env.local is git-ignored.
# Never paste a real key into chat, issues, logs or commits.
# Server-side only: never prefix with VITE_ or expose to the browser.

# Cline API key (created in the Cline dashboard; see docs/HANDOFF.md).
CLINE_API_KEY=

# Vision-capable model ID available to your account. Verified for this project:
# anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5
CLINE_MODEL_ID=

# --- optional (hosting) ---
# PORT is set by the host; when PORT is set the server binds 0.0.0.0 (override with HOST).
# PORT=
# HOST=
# Set to 1 behind a single reverse proxy so per-IP rate limiting sees real client IPs.
# TRUST_PROXY=
# Global cap on AI extraction calls per hour across all users (default 120).
# EXTRACT_MAX_PER_HOUR=
